(st name desc)←getConfigFlag index;name_ptr;desc_ptr;count
⍝ Read one configuration flag metadata tuple by index.
⍝ returns: (duckdb_state flag_name flag_description)

count←configCount
:If index<0
    st←DuckDBError
    name←''
    desc←''
    →0
:EndIf
:If index≥count
    st←DuckDBError
    name←''
    desc←''
    →0
:EndIf

(st name_ptr desc_ptr)←api.duckdb_get_config_flag index 0 0
:If name_ptr=0
    name←''
:Else
    name←256 read.utf8 name_ptr
:EndIf
:If desc_ptr=0
    desc←''
:Else
    desc←512 read.utf8 desc_ptr
:EndIf

